  "result": "Done! I've added the `mergeCustomers` function to `src/customers.js` with comprehensive tests.\n\n**What was implemented:**\n\n1. **New error code** (`SAME_CUSTOMER`) in `src/errors.js` for when trying to merge a customer with itself\n\n2. **`mergeCustomers` function** that:\n   - Normalizes both customer IDs (trims whitespace, converts to uppercase)\n   - Returns `SAME_CUSTOMER` error if the IDs are identical\n   - Returns `CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND` error if either customer doesn't exist\n   - Removes the `fromId` customer from the array\n   - Reassigns all invoices belonging to `fromId` to `intoId`\n   - Returns `ok({ customers, invoices })`\n\n3. **Five test cases** covering:\n   - Successful merge with invoice reassignment\n   - Error when merging a customer with itself\n   - Error when `fromId` doesn't exist\n   - Error when `intoId` doesn't exist\n   - Case-insensitive IDs with whitespace handling\n\nAll 289 tests pass.",
